tion into the production environment.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Design System Architecture' activity is permitted to occur only if a 'Develop Integration Components' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Develop Integration Components\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Integration Components' activity includes building the components required for the integration.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Design System Architecture\",\"description\":\"The 'Design System Architecture' activity involves designing the architecture for the integration system.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Develop Integration Components' activity occurs, then a 'Test Integration' activity must eventually occur after the 'Develop Integration Components' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Develop Integration Components' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Test Integration' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Develop Integration Components'. If 'Develop Integration Components' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Test Integration'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Develop Integration Components\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Integration Components' activity includes building the components required for the integration.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Test Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Test Integration' activity involves testing the integration to verify it functions as expected.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Test Integration' activity must be followed by a 'Deploy Integration' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, a 'Deploy Integration' event can occur only if a 'Test Integration' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Test Integration' imposes obligations for future 'Deploy Integration', and 'Deploy Integration' cannot occur without prior 'Test Integration'. Multiple 'Test Integration' and 'Deploy Integration' are allowed, with each 'Test Integration' eventually leading to a 'Deploy Integration' and each 'Deploy Integration' being justified by a preceding 'Test Integration'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Test Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Test Integration' activity involves testing the integration to verify it functions as expected.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Integration' activity represents the deployment of the integration into the production environment.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever a 'Deploy Integration' activity occurs, it must be immediately followed by a 'Monitor System Performance' activity in the next event position, with no other events in between. The 'Monitor System Performance' activity is allowed to happen isolated.\",\"template\":\"Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Integration' activity represents the deployment of the integration into the production environment.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Monitor System Performance\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor System Performance' activity involves observing and tracking the performance of the system after integration.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Monitor System Performance' activity occurs, then 'Resolve Integration Issues' activity must occur after that 'Monitor System Performance' event and before any subsequent 'Monitor System Performance' occurs; no other occurrence of 'Monitor System Performance' is allowed between a 'Monitor System Performance' and 'Resolve Integration Issues'.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor System Performance\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor System Performance' activity involves observing and tracking the performance of the system after integration.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Resolve Integration Issues\",\"description\":\"The 'Resolve Integration Issues' activity involves identifying and fixing issues that arise from the integration.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Plan Integration' activity occurs in a process instance, then 'Document Integration Process' activity must also occur at least once within the same process instance, either before or after the 'Plan Integration' event. If 'Plan Integration' does not occur, there is no requirement for 'Document Integration Process' to occur. Multiple occurrences of 'Plan Integration' are satisfied by at least one occurrence of 'Document Integration Process', and multiple 'Document Integration Process' instances are allowed.\",\"template\":\"Responded Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Plan Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Plan Integration' activity represents the planning phase for organizing an integration effort.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Document Integration Process\",\"description\":\"The 'Document Integration Process' activity includes recording the details of the integration process for future reference.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Train Users' activity occurs, then 'Deploy Integration' must also occur in the same process instance, and vice-versa.\",\"template\":\"Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Train Users\",\"description\":\"The 'Train Users' activity involves training users on how to use the newly integrated system.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Integration' activity represents the deployment of the integration into the production environment.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Review Integration Plan' activity cannot be immediately followed by an 'Approve Integration Design' activity; there must be at least one other event between them. Similarly, an 'Approve Integration Design' event cannot be immediately preceded by a 'Review Integration Plan' event. This constraint allows multiple occurrences of 'Review Integration Plan' and 'Approve Integration Design' in any order, provided they are not adjacent in the event sequence.\",\"template\":\"Not Chain Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Review Integration Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Integration Plan' activity involves reviewing the plan created for the integration effort.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Approve Integration Design\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Integration Design' activity involves granting approval for the proposed integration design.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"An 'Approve Integration Design' activity cannot be preceded by a 'Validate Integration Results' within the same process instance. If a 'Validate Integration Results' event has occurred at any point before an 'Approve Integration Design' event, then 'Approve Integration Design' is disallowed. Multiple instances of 'Approve Integration Design' and 'Validate Integration Results' can occur, but all instances of 'Approve Integration Design' must occur before any instance of 'Validate Integration Results'.\",\"template\":\"Not Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Validate Integration Results\",\"description\":\"The 'Validate Integration Results' activity involves confirming that the integration results meet the required standards.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Approve Integration Design\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Integration Design' activity involves granting approval for the proposed integration design.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Update System Documentation' activity must not be followed by a 'Gather User Feedback' activity at any point later in the same process instance. This means that once an 'Update System Documentation' event occurs, 'Gather User Feedback' cannot occur afterward. However, 'Gather User Feedback' events occurring before the 'Update System Documentation' are permitted. The constraint ensures that after the occurrence of 'Update System Documentation', the process does not allow any further occurrences of 'Gather User Feedback'.\",\"template\":\"Not Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Update System Documentation\",\"description\":\"The 'Update System Documentation' activity involves updating documentation to reflect changes made to the system.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Gather User Feedback\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather User Feedback' activity involves collecting feedback from users regarding the integration.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"At least one of the activities 'Plan Integration' or 'Design System Architecture' must occur in the process instance. This means that the process is compliant if 'Plan Integration' event occurs, 'Design System Architecture' event occurs, or both occur. There is no restriction on the order or the number of times they occur. However, if neither 'Plan Integration' nor 'Design System Architecture' occurs, the constraint is violated.\",\"template\":\"Choice\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Plan Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Plan Integration' activity represents the planning phase for organizing an integration effort.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Design System Architecture\",\"description\":\"The 'Design System Architecture' activity involves designing the architecture for the integration system.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Exactly one of the activities 'Test Integration' or 'Deploy Integration' must occur in the process instance. This means that the process is compliant if only 'Test Integration' event occurs without any occurrence of 'Deploy Integration' event, or only 'Deploy Integration' occurs without any occurrence of 'Test Integration'. The process is non-compliant if both 'Test Integration' and 'Deploy Integration' occur, or if neither occurs. The constraint enforces a mutual exclusivity and a mandatory occurrence of one of the specified activities.\",\"template\":\"Exclusive Choice\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Test Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Test Integration' activity involves testing the integration to verify it functions as expected.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Integration' activity represents the deployment of the integration into the production environment.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Deploy Integration' activity occurs and, at that time, the attribute condition 'A.Integration Status is Failed' holds true, then a 'Resolve Integration Issues' activity must eventually occur after the 'Deploy Integration' event within the same process instance, and specifically within a time window of 0 to 24 hours after the 'Deploy Integration' event. There is no requirement on what events may occur in between, as long as the 'Resolve Integration Issues' activity occurs within the specified timeframe. If 'Deploy Integration' occurs but the 'Integration Status' attribute is not 'Failed', the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Resolve Integration Issues'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Integration\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Integration' activity represents the deployment of the integration into the production environment.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Resolve Integration Issues\",\"description\":\"The 'Resolve Integration Issues' activity involves identifying and fixing issues that arise from the integration.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Integration Status is Failed\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,24,h\",\"cardinality\":null}]}"